Apex Dental community source

Derived from Open Dental, https://github.com/OpenDental/opendental
Upstream baseline: d804c19546233593d8a66af0591ed118a9e2c794 (24.3.63.0).
Original copyrights, license headers, and LICENSE are retained.
Open Dental is an upstream product name; this independent fork claims no
endorsement or ownership of upstream trademarks.

This source snapshot adds a .NET 8 headless Linux port, browser UI, local
Whisper transcription, and related practice workflows developed in the fork.
Public preparation changes dated 2026-10-24:
- Selected the headless business-layer and web source; omitted Windows apps,
  private strategy, operational notes, credentials, and service implementations.
- Replaced direct cloud transcription with an optional generic HTTP interface.
- Required explicit database credentials; disabled demo seeding by default and
  removed the demo Admin password reset and publicly advertised demo passwords.
- Corrected an inherited resource path for case-sensitive Linux builds and
  updated MailKit to 4.16.0.
- Added source publication checks and checksum-pinned external dependency restore.

Fork application changes are provided under GPL-2.0-only, consistent with the
inherited application licensing. Third-party notices remain applicable to their
respective files. Upstream dependency license texts are retained under
OpenDental/Resources; see docs/DEPENDENCIES.md for limits of that inventory.

Additional public boundary changes, 2026-10-24:
- Removed vendor cloud SDKs and embedded provider transports from this snapshot.
- Replaced cloud mail, document storage, and tax transport with optional HTTP clients.
- Preserved local SMTP, local/database document storage, and clinician-reviewed dictation.
- Added a reviewed source inventory and stricter dependency/reference checks.

Release preparation, 2026-10-25:
- Explicit dictation engine selection, HTTPS service mode, and per-engine disclosure.
- Independently enabled/scoped mail, storage, transfer, and tax service clients.
- Public source inventory checks for both index and working tree; neutral tooling.
- Dated change notices on modified inherited files and preview-accurate site source.
- Pinned the .NET 8 SDK and C# 12 to keep CI consistent with local builds.
